{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"groovy","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Groovy and Gradle","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Groovy and Gradle (.groovy .gradle .gvy .jenkinsfile).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"groovy","name":"Groovy and Gradle","extensions":[".groovy",".gradle",".gvy",".jenkinsfile"],"grammar":"grammars/groovy.json","filenames":["Jenkinsfile"],"lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Groovy and Gradle","path":"snippets/groovy.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/groovy.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"'''\",\n      \"end\": \"'''\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:implements|instanceof|interface|protected|abstract|continue|volatile|default|extends|finally|package|private|assert|import|public|return|static|switch|throws|break|catch|class|final|super|throw|trait|while|case|else|enum|this|def|for|new|try|as|do|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:boolean|Closure|String|double|Object|float|long|void|List|int|Map|Set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:testImplementation|implementation|dependencies|repositories|compileOnly|runtimeOnly|pipeline|println|plugins|print|apply|stage|steps|task|node|api|sh)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/groovy.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Gradle dependency\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dep\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"implementation '${1:group}:${2:artifact}:${3:version}'\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A dependency\"\n  },\n  \"Gradle task\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"task\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"tasks.register('${1:name}') {\",\n      \"\\tdoLast {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Gradle task\"\n  },\n  \"Jenkins stage\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"stage\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"stage('${1:Build}') {\",\n      \"\\tsteps {\",\n      \"\\t\\tsh '${2:make}'\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A pipeline stage\"\n  },\n  \"Method\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"def\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"def ${1:name}(${2:args}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A method\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Groovy and Gradle\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Groovy and Gradle.\n\n## Files\n\n`.groovy`, `.gradle`, `.gvy`, `.jenkinsfile`, `Jenkinsfile`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `dep` | A dependency |\n| `task` | A Gradle task |\n| `stage` | A pipeline stage |\n| `def` | A method |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}